==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**4 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Simply spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] for an easy victory.

